@@s057 How to read the atlas
@@s058 The explanations are <b>sheets</b> written one step at a time (Next, or the arrows <kbd>&larr;</kbd> <kbd>&rarr;</kbd> after clicking on the sheet). The colours always have the same role:
@@s059 <i></i>orange &middot; the thing that changes now
@@s060 <i></i>blue &middot; the starting data
@@s061 <i></i>purple &middot; a second role
@@s062 <i></i>green &middot; the result
@@s063 <i></i>red &middot; discarded or wrong
